{
 "esm": "1.1.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "FilteredScan",
  "description": "Filtered faq nodes (spec \u00a73.5): an inclusive forward scan of a (gathered, a `where` guard j <= i) minus an exclusive reverse scan of b\u00b2 (j > i); b reads a filtered contracting observed s[i] = \u03a3_{j<=i} a[j]\u00b2 (a nested filtered sum: its lifted column takes the guard) and a window with an index conjunct j < i and a value conjunct a[j] > 0.4 (the value gate stays in the coefficient, the pattern is the whole window); q is reseact's Mz shape, an exclusive level scan gk < gke over (gi, gke) rows, plus a window clipped by a constant (gk >= 2) that splits the box instead of guarding it."
 },
